# Windows clones default to core.autocrlf=true, which checks text files out
# with CRLF. That breaks SKILL.md frontmatter parsing and makes
# `prettier --check` (endOfLine: lf) report every file. Keep LF everywhere;
# text=auto keeps Git's own binary detection.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary by declaration, so a wrong guess can never rewrite these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
